# Mandatory Omorphia rules

Before taking action, read the root `AGENTS.md` and the full `AI/AGENT-PROMPT.md`.

For UI, component, styling, or showcase work, read the complete Modernimal stylesheet in `aabhro/Stylesheets`, inspect `Components/Modernimal.html`, and inspect the mandatory `motion/` references. The Stylesheets repository is private. If the references are inaccessible, ask for access or the missing files rather than guessing or silently skipping them.

Use the style-selection checkpoint for new apps, meaningful UI features, or substantial redesigns. Modernimal is the recommended default. Ask conversationally when the user has not already chosen a style. Preserve an existing project's style for maintenance work.

Keep Omorphia framework-free and CDN-first. Preserve its native custom-element API, dark/light theming, and signature directional edge illumination. Edit source in `src/`, not generated files in `dist/`. Use the existing build and test scripts: `npm run build` and `npm test`.

Follow the complete instructions in `AGENTS.md` and `AI/AGENT-PROMPT.md`; this short rule is only an entry point.